    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  --> http_route_custom_method.jet:10:5
    |
 10 |     #Server.Custom("PURGE", "/marked")
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ first registered here
 Why: Pages, convention files, handler routes and marked methods share one route table, so two rows with one method and address make dispatch ambiguous and one of them would never be reached. A route added while the program runs is checked when it is added.
 Fix: Remove one of the two registrations, rename the convention file, or make the addresses distinct (e.g. mount one under its own prefix).
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2804

Error [jet.RouteMethodTokenRefused]: HTTPRouter custom route method must be a static String
  --> http_route_custom_method.jet:33:19
    |
 33 |     router.custom(names[0], "/cache", handle)
    |                   ^^^^^
 Why: Router and `#Server.Custom` routes are fully checked while building; only an App takes a run-time method, checked when it registers
 Fix: Use a literal or compile-time String constant, or register the route on a `web.app()`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2808
